---

UNGEMACH's engine, waveforms and tables are original work. It reads the
sequencer's clock, tempo and track speed at the RAM locations Euclid reads
(sdk/octabam/modules/euclid/control.c, MIT, Sam Banks); no code is copied from
it. It contains no Elektron firmware, extracted routines, tables, samples or
graphics: the machine page copies stock's FLEX page record at run time on the
user's own unit and never ships it. Nothing here is endorsed by, supported by
or affiliated with Elektron. Octatrack and Elektron are trademarks of Elektron
Music Machines MAV AB, used only to name the hardware this module runs on.
